WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.511
With a camera.

00:02.211 --> 00:06.320
A camera can keep its shutter open and let the light pile up.

00:06.770 --> 00:08.660
Now the colour is there.

00:09.110 --> 00:10.795
It was always there.

00:11.245 --> 00:13.612
The red is hydrogen gas.

00:14.062 --> 00:22.605
This picture was taken through colour filters with an extra one for glowing hydrogen, so the red is stronger than an eye would find it.
